{"id":2625,"path":"/grammar-points/a2/past-simple-form-use/","parentId":542,"order":30,"section":"grammar-points","level":"a2","depth":3,"title":"Past simple: Form and use","seo":{"title":"Past simple: Form and use - Test-English","description":"Master the Past Simple with our A2 pre-intermediate grammar lesson, featuring intuitive charts, interactive exercises, and vivid examples!","image":"/media/uploads/A2%E2%80%93Past-simple.png"},"modified":"2026-02-19T12:02:57","kind":"lesson","parts":["<h3>Exercise 1</h3> <h5>Choose the correct past simple forms to complete the sentences below.</h5> <div data-quiz=\"324\"></div>","<h3>Exercise 2</h3> <h5>Choose the correct&nbsp;past simple forms for the gaps below.</h5> <div data-quiz=\"325\"></div>","<h3>Exercise 3</h3> <h5>Fill in the gaps with&nbsp;the correct&nbsp;past simple forms of the verbs in brackets.</h5> <div data-quiz=\"326\"></div>"],"explanation":"<h2>Past simple: Form</h2> <p><img src=\"/media/uploads/past-simple_form_A2-new.jpg\" alt=\"Educational chart outlining the Past Simple form in positive, negative, and question structures, with short answer examples and common mistakes.\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-19456\" loading=\"lazy\"></p> <h6></h6> <h4>Spelling of regular verbs</h4> <p><img src=\"/media/uploads/past-regular-ed-spelling.png\" alt=\"Grammar chart explaining the spelling rules for forming the past simple of regular verbs with '-ed', including examples and variations based on verb endings.\" width=\"500\" height=\"362\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-20491\" loading=\"lazy\"></p> <h6></h6> <h2>Past simple: Use</h2> <h4>Completed actions in the past</h4> <p>We use the <a href=\"/grammar-points/a1/past-simple-regular-irregular/\">past simple</a> to talk about actions or events that happened in the past. We know, or we say, when the events happened.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>I <strong><span>saw</span></strong> Jim yesterday.&nbsp;</em></li> <li><em>We <span><strong>didn’t go out</strong></span> last Saturday. We <span><strong>stayed</strong></span>&nbsp;at home.</em></li> <li><em>She <strong><span>moved</span></strong> to Chester three years ago.</em></li> </ul> <h4>Past habits</h4> <p>We use the past simple to talk about past habits (things that we did more or less often).</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>She <strong><span>washed</span></strong> her hair every day.</em></li> <li><em>She <span><strong>worked</strong></span> as a nurse.</em></li> <li><em>I often <span><strong>played</strong></span> in the park when we were children.&nbsp;</em></li> </ul> <h4>Situations that were true in the past</h4> <p>We also use the past simple to talk about things that were true in the past.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>My grandfather <span><strong>had</strong></span> two brothers.</em></li> <li><em>He <span><strong>lived</strong></span> with my grandparents as a child.&nbsp;</em></li> </ul> <h4>Events in chronological order</h4> <p>We use the past simple to describe the main events of a story in chronological order.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>When I <span><strong>arrived</strong></span>&nbsp;home, I <span><strong>took off</strong></span> my shoes and then I <span><strong>relaxed</strong></span> on the sofa</em>.</li> </ul>","quizzes":[{"id":324,"questions":[{"id":2803,"num":"1","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>We <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> to Vancouver on holiday.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["did go","goed","went"]}]},{"id":2804,"num":"2","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p><span data-gap=\"0\"></span> by plane?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["Did you went","Did you go","Went you"]}]},{"id":2805,"num":"3","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Jack <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> with us.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["wasn't come","didn't came","didn't come"]}]},{"id":2806,"num":"4","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>The car suddenly <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["stopped","stoped","did stop"]}]},{"id":2807,"num":"5","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>When she arrived he <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> at home.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["didn't was","wasn't","weren't"]}]},{"id":2808,"num":"6","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>The police <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> the robber.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["caught","catched","was catch"]}]},{"id":2809,"num":"7","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> a black shirt for the gala.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["chose","choosed","did choose"]}]},{"id":2810,"num":"8","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>The meeting <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> well.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["didn't go","didn't went","went not"]}]},{"id":2811,"num":"9","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Manchester United <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> the final.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["lost","losed","did lose"]}]},{"id":2812,"num":"10","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>How much <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> for the car?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["payed you","did you pay","did you payed"]}]}]},{"id":325,"questions":[{"id":2813,"num":"1","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>He always _____ on the same chair. </div>","choices":[{"id":4844,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>sat</span>"},{"id":4845,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>sit</span>"},{"id":4846,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>sitted</span>"}]},{"id":2814,"num":"2","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>Where _____ the keys?</div>","choices":[{"id":4847,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>you found</span>"},{"id":4848,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>did you found</span>"},{"id":4849,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>did you find</span>"}]},{"id":2815,"num":"3","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>He _____ the cable with a cutting knife.</div>","choices":[{"id":4850,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>did cut</span>"},{"id":4851,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>cut</span>"},{"id":4852,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>cutted</span>"}]},{"id":2816,"num":"4","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>I _____ where to go.</div>","choices":[{"id":4853,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>knew not</span>"},{"id":4854,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>didn't knew</span>"},{"id":4855,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>didn't know</span>"}]},{"id":2817,"num":"5","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>They _____ very friendly to us. </div>","choices":[{"id":4856,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>weren't</span>"},{"id":4857,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>didn't be</span>"},{"id":4858,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>wasn't</span>"}]},{"id":2818,"num":"6","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>She _____ her son upstairs to bed. </div>","choices":[{"id":4859,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>carryed</span>"},{"id":4860,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>carried</span>"},{"id":4861,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>was carry</span>"}]},{"id":2819,"num":"7","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>We _____ to New York last summer.</div>","choices":[{"id":4862,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>were fly</span>"},{"id":4863,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>flow</span>"},{"id":4864,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>flew</span>"}]},{"id":2820,"num":"8","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>_____ that noise?</div>","choices":[{"id":4865,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>Did you hear</span>"},{"id":4866,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>You heard</span>"},{"id":4867,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>Did you heard</span>"}]},{"id":2821,"num":"9","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>I _____ that glass. It _____ Daisy. </div>","choices":[{"id":4868,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>didn't break / was</span>"},{"id":4869,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>didn't break / were</span>"},{"id":4870,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>wasn't break / was</span>"}]},{"id":2822,"num":"10","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>He _____ me some chocolates, but I ______ them.</div>","choices":[{"id":4871,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>bringed / didn't accept</span>"},{"id":4872,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>brought / didn't accept</span>"},{"id":4873,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>brought / wasn't accept</span>"}]}]},{"id":326,"questions":[{"id":2823,"num":"","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p class=\"double-line-height\">Two summers ago we <span class=\"numBox\">1</span> <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> (have) a holiday in Scotland. We&nbsp;<span class=\"numBox\">2</span> <span data-gap=\"1\"></span> (drive) there from London, but our car&nbsp;<span class=\"numBox\">3</span> <span data-gap=\"2\"></span> (break) down on the motorway and we&nbsp;<span class=\"numBox\">4</span> <span data-gap=\"3\"></span> (spend) the first night in Birmingham.</p> <p class=\"double-line-height\">When we <span class=\"numBox\">5</span> <span data-gap=\"4\"></span> (get) to Edinburgh we&nbsp;<span class=\"numBox\">6</span> <span data-gap=\"5\"></span> (not can) find a good hotel - there <span class=\"numBox\">7</span> <span data-gap=\"6\"></span> (not be) any available rooms. We <span class=\"numBox\">8</span> <span data-gap=\"7\"></span> (not know) what to do but in the end we&nbsp;<span class=\"numBox\">9</span> <span data-gap=\"8\"></span> (find) a bed and breakfast and we <span class=\"numBox\">10</span> <span data-gap=\"9\"></span> (stay) there for the week.</p> <p class=\"double-line-height\">We <span class=\"numBox\">11</span> <span data-gap=\"10\"></span> (see) the castle, <span class=\"numBox\">12</span> <span data-gap=\"11\"></span> (go) to the Arts Festival, and we <span class=\"numBox\">13</span> <span data-gap=\"12\"></span> (buy) a lot of souvenirs. We&nbsp;<span class=\"numBox\">14</span> <span data-gap=\"13\"></span> (want) to go to Loch Ness but we&nbsp;<span class=\"numBox\">15</span> <span data-gap=\"14\"></span> (not have) much time and it&nbsp;<span class=\"numBox\">16</span> <span data-gap=\"15\"></span> (be) quite far away. The weather&nbsp;<span class=\"numBox\">17</span> <span data-gap=\"16\"></span> (be) good, but it&nbsp;<span class=\"numBox\">18</span> <span data-gap=\"17\"></span> (start) raining the day we <span class=\"numBox\">19</span> <span data-gap=\"18\"></span> (leave). We <span class=\"numBox\">20</span> <span data-gap=\"19\"></span> (have) a great time.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]}]}]}